<title>MEXICO: Tribasa wins $16 mln Codelco contract.</title>
<headline>Tribasa wins $16 mln Codelco contract.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Tribasa, Mexico's second-largest construction company, said Tuesday it had won a $16 million contract with Chilean state copper company Codelco.</p>
<p>Tribasa said in a statement that the contract, to build a damn for the mining giant, was awarded through the Andean division of Codelco. &quot;This is the first foray that Tribasa has made in the great Chilean mining industry,&quot; Tribasa said.</p>
<p>((--Daniel Perez-Whitaker, Monterrey bureau +528 3457617))</p>
